    <string name="screen_pinning_title">Handing your phone to someone else?</string>
    <string name="screen_pinning_body">No app, including this one, can stop someone from reaching Settings once your phone is unlocked. Android\'s built-in screen pinning can: open the app you\'re handing over, go to Recents, tap its icon, then Pin. While pinned, nothing else — including Settings — is reachable until it\'s unpinned.</string>
    <string name="screen_pinning_button">Open security settings</string>

